{"__q": {"t": "Прошедшие времена — Сборник 1", "q": [{"s": "Choose the past form of «go».", "o": ["gone", "goed", "going", "went"], "e": "Неправильный глагол: go – went – gone."}, {"s": "Complete: «I ___ him yesterday.»", "o": ["seeing", "see", "have seen", "saw"], "e": "«Yesterday» — указатель Past Simple."}, {"s": "Choose: «While I ___, the phone rang.»", "o": ["cook", "have cooked", "was cooking", "cooked"], "e": "«While» требует Past Continuous."}, {"s": "Complete: «He ___ the book before the film came out.»", "o": ["has read", "read", "had read", "was reading"], "e": "Действие, предшествовавшее другому действию в прошлом → Past Perfect."}, {"s": "Which is the past of «write»?", "o": ["writing", "wrote", "written", "writed"], "e": "write – wrote – written."}, {"s": "Complete: «They ___ to the cinema last night.»", "o": ["have gone", "went", "going", "go"], "e": "«Last night» — указатель прошедшего времени."}, {"s": "Choose: «I ___ TV when she arrived.»", "o": ["watch", "had watched", "watched", "was watching"], "e": "Событие, прервавшее длившееся действие."}, {"s": "Complete: «She ___ in Baku for five years before she moved.»", "o": ["lived", "had lived", "lives", "has lived"], "e": "Более ранний период в прошлом."}, {"s": "Which is correct?", "o": ["Did you go?", "Did you went?", "Did you gone?", "Do you went?"], "e": "После «did» глагол стоит в начальной форме."}, {"s": "Complete: «I used ___ in London.»", "o": ["live", "lived", "living", "to live"], "e": "«Used to» + инфинитив."}]}, "Past Tenses — 1-ci toplu": "Прошедшие времена — Сборник 1"}